# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the host tests.
#
# TFSXW1Controller::initRegistryTable() allocates the RegistryTable with `new`
# and nothing deletes it. On the device that is by design: the bridge creates
# one controller at boot and it lives until reset. The tests construct and
# destroy a controller per case, so LSan reports each table. Suppress exactly
# that allocation; any other leak still fails the run.
leak:FujitsuAC::TFSXW1Controller::initRegistryTable
